[gd_scene format=3]

; The Cell, a secret behind the Sacristy's false west wall (map offset (-45.5, 0)): a maker's cell, low and dark, found by
; walking into a wall that is not one. A strength power-up on a low plinth, a plate. A dead end; the way out is the doorway east,
; back through the false wall.

